  "goodToKnow": "Der Bestatter or die Bestatterin is an undertaker or funeral director, working for a Bestattungsinstitut. Bestatten means to bury or inter, and die Bestattung is the burial or funeral. Germany has strict rules: most states require burial in a cemetery (Friedhofszwang), though some have relaxed this. The plural is the same: die Bestatter."
